{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120858","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120858/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120858/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120858/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120858","id":4795994551,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7tM8N4","number":120858,"title":"[Render] Crash Fix use-after-return instance shader parameter lists","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-02T15:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T18:38:12Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T17:54:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120858","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120858.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120858.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-02T17:54:13Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCrash in released game when upgrading to 4.7 sigsev crash most on Quest 3 and Steam versions.\r\nSigsev crash which could be hit by anyone I think not sure why we are the first to report it from what I can tell.\r\nThis resolved our issue by introducing a sync into the prop list. Not sure if there is a less coarse mechanism for this.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nUpgrading our game to 4.7 we started getting a crash and managed to use dmps to track it down to a use after free of a list and isolated it to \r\n\r\n    Fatal signal 11 (SIGSEGV) ... fault addr 0xe7fea88ca3c79ed5\r\n    #00 List<PropertyInfo>::push_back(PropertyInfo const&)\r\n    #01 CommandQueueMT::_flush()\r\n    #02 CommandQueueMT::flush_all()\r\n    #03 Callable::call()\r\n    #04 WorkerThreadPool::_thread_function()\r\n\r\nFuurther investigation led us to prop lists on instances.\r\n\r\nGeometryInstance3D::_get_property_list() and CanvasItem::_get_property_list() each build a temporary List<PropertyInfo> on their own stack, ask RenderingServer to fill it with the node's per-instance shader parameters, then immediately read the list and return it.\r\n\r\nThis is easy to trigger by accident. Both _get_property_list() overrides run unconditionally whenever anything enumerates the node's properties - most commonly Node.duplicate() or scene saving - even if the node has no instance shader parameters set at all. Any project that duplicates or pools mesh or canvas item nodes at runtime can hit this, and because it depends on whether the caller's stack happens to be overwritten before the background thread catches up, it shows up intermittently rather than on every call. \r\n\r\nObviously this could introduce a slowdown but it doesn't look like its on any super hot paths. Not sure if there is a better fix but this resolved our issue for now. Hope this helps.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120858/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120858/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}